<title>USA: AMC to build movie megaplex in Portugal.</title>
<headline>AMC to build movie megaplex in Portugal.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMC Entertainment Inc said it is building a movie theatre megaplex in Portugal, the company's first megaplex project in Europe.</p>
<p>AMC Arrabida 20, with 20 screens and 4,253 seats, is targeted to open December 20 in Porto, Portugal, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
